    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Haijibu</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Huonyesha vyanzo vya TV na programu zake zote, hubadilisha chanzo kwenye TV zisizojali vitufe vya HDMI, na huweka ung\'avu kwenye baadhi. Hufanya kazi kupitia muunganisho wa debugging wa TV (ADB). Vitufe na kuandika hufanya kazi vilevile bila hiyo.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Unganisha</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV ilikataa muunganisho. Hakikisha USB debugging imewashwa. Tangu Android TV 14 baadhi ya TV hukubali Wireless debugging pekee, ambayo TennaRC haiwezi kutumia bado.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging imezimwa kwenye TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV imesahau simu hii, kama Android TV hufanya kwa kifaa ambacho haijakiona kwa wiki moja. Jaribu tena, na uruhusu kwenye TV.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV imesahau simu hii</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed">Hakuna aliyeruhusu kwenye TV. Jaribu tena, na uchague OK hapo.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed_short">Hairuhusiwi kwenye TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">Imezimwa. Huongeza vyanzo na programu zote</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Gusa Unganisha, kisha kwenye TV weka alama kwenye Always allow na uchague OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Fungua Developer options, kando ya About, kisha washa USB debugging. Kwenye Shield ni Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Kwenye TV, fungua Settings › System › About kisha chagua Android TV OS build mara saba. Kwenye TV za zamani ni Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_title">Muunganisho wa msanidi</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Zima</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Wireless debugging pekee ndiyo imewashwa, ambayo TennaRC haiwezi kutumia bado. Washa pia USB debugging, au oanisha mara moja kutoka kwenye kompyuta na uendeshe adb tcpip 5555, ambayo hudumu hadi TV iwake upya.</string>
